  "title": "editcap: Fix handling of unrecognized long options",
  "description": "The common ws_getopt_long handles reporting if options are\nunrecognized or require arguments, so we don't need to do\nit again in editcap, so we can remove the leading colon in\nthe optstring. This allows ws_getopt to handle it better\nwhen an unrecognized long option is used.\n\nCurrently it prints out a null by trying to output the single-letter\noption for unrecognized long options, i.e.\n\n    editcap: invalid option -- ''\n\ninstead of the long option actually input.",
